>BIFLS00591 queuine tRNA-ribosyltransferase

>GLUAR00344 queuine tRNA-ribosyltransferase exchanges the guanine residue with 7-aminomethyl-7- deazaguanine in tRNAs with GU(N) anticodons (tRNA-Asp, - Asn, -His and -Tyr). After this exchange, a cyclopentendiol moiety is attached to the 7-aminomethyl group of 7-deazaguanine, resulting in the hypermodified nucleoside queuosine (Q) (7-(((4,5-cis-dihydroxy-2- cyclopenten-1-yl)amino)methyl)- 7-deazaguanosine)

